---
// AboutSection.astro — About Archex: Purpose, Philosophy & Accountability
---

<section class="section-wrapper about-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Editorial Headline & Identity Statement -->
      <div class="about-left">
        <span class="tech-tag">About Archex</span>
        <h2 id="about-title" class="about-heading">
          Independent thinking.<br />
          Purposeful execution<span class="hl-dot">.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="about-statement">
          Archex brings together technology, creative thinking and go-to-market expertise to help ideas become meaningful products, experiences and businesses.
        </p>

        <div class="about-cta-box">
          <a href="/about" class="btn-base btn-secondary" title="Read in-depth about Archex">
            <span>Read full about Archex</span>
            <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Four Core Pillars of Archex -->
      <div class="about-right">
        <div class="about-pillars">
          <!-- Pillar 1 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-index">01</span>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">Why Archex exists</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-body">
              Digital initiatives frequently falter when fractured across disconnected web developers, design shops and marketing consultants. Archex provides a unified ecosystem where software engineering, brand identity and commercial strategy inform each other from inception.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Pillar 2 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-index">02</span>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">The thinking behind three practices</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-body">
              Instead of a sprawling, generalized agency, Archex operates through three dedicated disciplines: Craft (software engineering), Studio (brand identity & digital experiences), and GTM (go-to-market & growth). Each retains deep focus while collaborating seamlessly.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Pillar 3 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-index">03</span>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">Our approach to problem solving</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-body">
              We apply first-principles enquiry over agency trends. We dissect core user needs, architectural realities, and market mechanics, ensuring every interface designed and line of code written serves a verified objective.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Pillar 4 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-index">04</span>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">Thoughtful execution and accountability</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-body">
              Sound strategy is meaningless without disciplined delivery. We prioritize reliability, long-term maintainability, and measurable progress, taking direct ownership of the systems we build and the outcomes we shape.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    background-color: var(--paper-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.35fr;
    gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .about-left {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-height) + 32px);
  }

  .about-heading {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 3.8vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hl-dot {
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .about-statement {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 18.5px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-graphite);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .about-cta-box {
    padding-top: 16px;
  }

  /* Pillars Stack */
  .about-pillars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background-color: var(--paper-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 32px);
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .pillar-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pillar-index {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--signal);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pillar-title {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.4vw, 20px);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pillar-body {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-graphite);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about-left {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>

